\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Leave-one-video-out prediction with training-only outcome scaling.} Panels A and B show mean RMSE across 28 held-video folds in original outcome units and training-fold standard-deviation units, respectively. Panel C compares rating-only and combined models against the assigned-label model using original-unit fold errors. Tests are paired two-sided Wilcoxon comparisons across held videos, with BH correction across the 12 comparisons; negative differences favor the first model named.}}{1}\protected@file@percent }
